# Facts about Lyra Vaneshade (design §10.1). Tiers: surface (known on meeting),
# personal (closeness), secret (specific events). Shown in the People panel in phase 4.

@fact lyra.prodigy
tier: surface
text: The pyromancy prodigy of House Vaneshade. Everyone knows the name, and she makes sure of it.

@fact lyra.toast
tier: personal
hint: Catch her at breakfast.
unlock: seen(lyra_toast) > 0
text: She can incinerate a target at forty paces. She cannot make toast.

@fact lyra.mother
tier: personal
hint: Get closer, and ask about her letters home.
unlock: rel(lyra) >= 18
text: Her mother has never once told her "well done".

@fact lyra.second_place
tier: personal
hint: Ask her about the Winter Trials.
unlock: seen(lyra_letter) > 0
text: She came second in the Winter Trials once. Her mother wrote to ask who beat her.

@fact lyra.burnout
tier: secret
hint: Watch how late her lamp burns.
unlock: seen(lyra_burnout) > 0
text: She studies until she collapses, and begs you not to let her mother find out.

@fact lyra.rival
tier: personal
hint: Be the rival she can't shake.
unlock: bond(lyra) == "rival"
text: You are the only person here who makes her better. She hates it. She doesn't want it to stop.

@fact lyra.inheritance
tier: secret
hint: Her mother may have something to say about you.
unlock: flag(lyra_free)
text: Her mother threatened her inheritance over you. She set the letter on fire.

@fact lyra.wildfire
tier: personal
hint: Get truly close to her.
unlock: seen(lyra_become_close) > 0
text: Vaneshades sleep exactly eight hours; she can't sleep. Her grandmother's spell, Wildfire, was only for people she trusted, and Lyra has never had anyone to teach it to.

@fact lyra.flourish
tier: personal
hint: Ask her to teach you something of her family's.
unlock: seen(lyra_teach_spell) > 0
text: Her family has opened its duels with the same ribbon-of-flame flourish for two hundred years. Teaching it outside the family is not done.
